  "instructions": [
    "Combine flour, yeast, and salt in a large mixing bowl.",
    "Gradually add water and mix until a shaggy dough forms.",
    "Knead the dough for 5 minutes until smooth and elastic.",
    "Place the dough in a greased bowl, cover with a damp cloth, and let rise in a warm place for 1 hour.",
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Roll out the dough to a thickness of 1/8 inch. Cut into 6-8 equal pieces.",
    "Roll each piece into a ball and then flatten into a disk shape.",
    "Place a tablespoon of almond paste in the center of each disk.",
    "Top with a spoonful of pickled cucumber and a sprinkle of mozzarella cheese.",
    "Fold the dough in half to form a half-moon shape and press the edges to seal.",
    "Bake for 15-20 minutes or until golden brown.",
    "Brush with melted butter before serving."
  ],
